[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891997\">5580M14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the junction unit.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a, 2b), adjusting the\nretainers (2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Navigation system display</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890273\">E65</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the band from the bridge for the junction unit.</p><p>4. Remove the junction unit and bridge.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035517.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the junction unit\nis not damaged.</p><p>Connect the band to the junction unit bridge.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the junction unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891997\">5580M14</a></p><p>Carry out the satellite navigator &#x27;Menù\nTest&#x27; (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2888296\">5580M</a>\n                                           ).</p>"]]